{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ACT","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"使徒行传","commonName":"使徒行传","title":"使徒行传","order":44,"numberOfChapters":28,"sha256":"5ec01722acec3751350d50a4c0efde3b9989b89ce67055e92f444b8544421bb6","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ACT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":28,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ACT/28.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1001},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["拣选七人办理供给的事"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那时，门徒增多，有说希腊话的犹太人向希伯来人发怨言，因为在天天的供给上忽略了他们的寡妇。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["十二使徒叫众门徒来，对他们说：「我们撇下 神的道去管理饭食，原是不合宜的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["所以弟兄们，当从你们中间选出七个有好名声、被圣灵充满、智慧充足的人，我们就派他们管理这事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["但我们要专心以祈祷、传道为事。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["大众都喜悦这话，就拣选了司提反，乃是大有信心、圣灵充满的人，又拣选腓利、伯罗哥罗、尼迦挪、提门、巴米拿，并进犹太教的安提阿人尼哥拉，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["叫他们站在使徒面前。使徒祷告了，就按手在他们头上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["神的道兴旺起来；在耶路撒冷门徒数目加增的甚多，也有许多祭司信从了这道。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["司提反被捕"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["司提反满得恩惠、能力，在民间行了大奇事和神迹。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["当时有称利百地拿会堂的几个人，并有古利奈、亚历山大、基利家、亚细亚各处会堂的几个人，都起来和司提反辩论。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["司提反是以智慧和圣灵说话，众人敌挡不住，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["就买出人来说：「我们听见他说谤 摩西和 神的话。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他们又耸动了百姓、长老，并文士，就忽然来捉拿他，把他带到公会去，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["设下假见证，说：「这个人说话，不住地糟践圣所和律法。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我们曾听见他说，这拿撒勒人耶稣要毁坏此地，也要改变摩西所交给我们的规条。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["在公会里坐着的人都定睛看他，见他的面貌，好像天使的面貌。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ACT/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ACT/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ACT/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}